[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SSDD (Software System Design Description)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSDD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: System Design Overview
STATEMENT: The system shall implement distributed architecture with microservices and containerized deployment.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSDD-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Component Design
STATEMENT: The system shall include network management, security, user interface, and data management components.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSDD-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Interface Design
STATEMENT: The system shall provide RESTful APIs and web-based user interfaces.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSDD-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Data Design
STATEMENT: The system shall use PostgreSQL database with optimized schema and performance tuning.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.